    - target: {fileID: 7361028110206237702, guid: ed8e2d54f72d44f42a56253d21a5cc3d, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: Mang Engko
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8946070191782132713, guid: ed8e2d54f72d44f42a56253d21a5cc3d, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Enabled
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8946070191782132713, guid: ed8e2d54f72d44f42a56253d21a5cc3d, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogues.Array.size
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8946070191782132713, guid: ed8e2d54f72d44f42a56253d21a5cc3d, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogues.Array.data[0].dialogueLines.Array.size
      value: 6
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8946070191782132713, guid: ed8e2d54f72d44f42a56253d21a5cc3d, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogues.Array.data[0].dialogueLines.Array.data[3].line
      value: Hindi mo na kailangan malaman kung paano ko nalalaman ang bawat detalye
        sa islang ito, alam ko at ramdam ko ang bawat nangyayare sa lugar na ito.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8946070191782132713, guid: ed8e2d54f72d44f42a56253d21a5cc3d, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogues.Array.data[0].dialogueLines.Array.data[11].line
      value: "Hindi ito sapat para iligtas ka sa mga tatahakin mo, pero sapat na
        ito para mabuhay ka ngayong gabi. Sige na umalis ka na bago pa lumalim ang
        gabi\u2026"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8946070191782132713, guid: ed8e2d54f72d44f42a56253d21a5cc3d, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogues.Array.data[0].dialogueLines.Array.data[12].line
      value: 'Osiya sige na, ngunit kunin mo itong sanga ng Kamagong at itong Anting-anting. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8946070191782132713, guid: ed8e2d54f72d44f42a56253d21a5cc3d, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogues.Array.data[0].dialogueLines.Array.data[3].characterName
      value: Mang Enko
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    m_RemovedComponents: []
    m_RemovedGameObjects: []
    m_AddedGameObjects: []
    m_AddedComponents:
